m_assets/steam/apps/2407200/extras/e0a0fc21175dfac85222650adc8297a1.mp4?t=1750429336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With its fast gameplay, catchy music, and immersive neon atmosphere, OVERWHELMED offers an addictive and challenging gaming experience you won't forget anytime soon. <br>Get ready to face the challenges ahead and become the master of OVERWHELMED!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The Overheat : Shooting increases the overheat value. When it reaches 100%, it unleashes an ability that damages enemies on contact, but disables the player's shooting.<br></li><li> Minimalist neon aesthetic<br></li><li> 10+ skills to unlock<br></li><li> 5 challenging bosses<br></li><li> 6 spaceships with their own gameplay</li></ul>",
